    "summary": "The Lord Discordant on Helstalker has an invulnerable save of 4+ and a Move of 14 inches. Its Impaler chainglaive has Lance and a melee profile of 5 attacks, WS 2+, Strength 8, AP −3 and Damage 3. At the opening of your Shooting phase, Corrupt Machine Spirits picks a visible enemy Vehicle within 12 inches and rolls a D6. Deal D3 mortal wounds on 2–3, 3 on 4–5, or D3+3 on a 6. Spirit Thief also picks a visible enemy Vehicle as your Shooting phase begins. Through phase end, friendly Heretic Astartes models reroll wound rolls of 1 when attacking that chosen Vehicle.",
